:: kitchen {"position":"700,825"}
<<scenery kitchen>>
You are currently standing in your kitchen.
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <<wanderingSlaves>>\
    <<set _slaves = Kitchen.getDemandingSlaves()>>\
    <<set _demandIndex to 0>>\
    <<include slaveDemand>>
    <<keyOption [[Leave your kitchen|main]] 🚪>>
    <<keyAction 'Have a meal' ☕>>
        <<set $player.energy = ($player.energy + 18).clamp(0, 100)>>
        <<addMinutes 45>>
    <</keyAction>>: 45min + 6 Energy
    <<if !$player.job or $player.workedToday or Now.isWeekend() or Now.isBetween('12:00 AM', '06:59 AM')>>\
        <<keyAction 'Go to sleep' 😴>><<sleep>><</keyAction>>
    <</if>>\
<</unlessEmergency>>\